          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pijagwile ula, cikumba cayice, nipo mbungo japujile ni kugomba pa nyumbajo, nipo jagwile. Kugwa kwakwe kwaliji kwakulindimukuka kwakogoya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.7.27",
